🔹 🎯 Task 1: Static vs Instance Fields
You are building a Counter class to observe how static fields are shared.
📥 Input:
Create three Counter objects.
⚙️ Requirements:
• Add an instance field id that is different for each object
• Add a static field totalCount that increases every time a new object is created
• Print each object’s id and the shared totalCount
📌 Constraints:
• Use only standard Java
• Output must match the required format exactly
📤 Output format:
Counter{id=<id>, total=<totalcount>}
(repeat for each object)
📌 Test cases:
Input: create 3 counters
Output:
Counter{id=1, total=3}
Counter{id=2, total=3}
Counter{id=3, total=3}</totalcount></id>

